  "details": "I primarily used Optimization & Safety/Security mods back in the day so I can still have a decent time when DJing in VRChat for a crowd of 40-80+ people in a single instance, plus all of the exclusive world effects when playing in places like Lyoko, TUBE, Ghost Club or even Sanctum/MUZZFest. DJing in VR for me is truly why I feel immersed and keep on coming back to this game, as it fills a void that reality just simply can't fill due to medical complications.\n\nPlease give us actual toggles and sliders instead of presets & anti-aliasing instead of leaving it to individual worlds, that is going to be annoying since ik some DJ's that perform at multiple venues in a day",
